/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105684","id":2830528388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otm-E","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:03:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:12:15Z","body":"> I wonder if there are any reasons that prevent _get_rid() from working like Texture2D.\r\n\r\nProbably just an implementation choice. Implement `get_rid()` in the base classes so you don't have to do it again on every material's child class.\r\n\r\n> When using set_material_rid(), users must remember to free the original rid. Otherwise, it will leak.\r\n\r\nIt's how it works when using servers directly, we need to do manual RID handling. Base classes in the engine usually don't create or free RIDs, they just define common functions for the child classes. If you don't want to handle the low-level part, you can use more specialized classes such as `ImageTexture` instead of `Texture2D` or `BaseMaterial` instead of `Material`, which provides a high-level API or lots of parameters for customization while internally handling RIDs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830528388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]